Z||000000||JohnnyK||05-17-2001||10:31 AM||||I had my final "fun" race last night. I still came in close to last (started there, didn't really gain any ground) but at least I didn't really spin out or anything. Getting to be able to handle those things better (you know, the whopping 6.5 hp is overwhelming). But at one point, 3 of us were in line (they were a bit ahead) adn I guess they got tangled and just came to a stop, and i came at them at full speed, and I had a millisecond to think "Awww crap" BOOM.. my god that hurt.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
